# Conventional Commits

Always use Conventional Commits when creating git commits in this repo.

## Format

```
type(optional-scope): short description
```

Allowed types: `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `style`, `refactor`, `perf`, `test`, `build`, `ci`, `chore`, `revert`.

## Examples

```
feat(hero): add entrance animation
fix(rsvp): correct form validation
chore: update Angular dependencies
ci: add commitlint workflow
```

## Do not

- `Updated stuff`
- `WIP`
- `fix bug`
- Skip validation with `--no-verify` unless the user explicitly asks

Este repo no tiene commitlint en el árbol. El formato se aplica igual en cada commit.
